Upstream implementations

sna/encoders/dreams.py implements the DreaMS encoder architecture:
https://github.com/pluskal-lab/DreaMS

sna/jestr.py implements JESTR's retrieval model without DGL:
https://github.com/HassounLab/JESTR1

Pretrained weights used by scripts/embed_ms2.py: the DreaMS MassSpecGym embedding model from
https://zenodo.org/records/10997887 (code MIT, weights CC-BY-4.0). The checkpoint is not
redistributed here; it is downloaded locally and pinned by SHA-256 in each run's provenance.

Frozen molecule encoders used by scripts/align_joint.py:
  MoLFormer-XL-both-10pct, https://huggingface.co/ibm-research/MoLFormer-XL-both-10pct (apache-2.0)
  ChemBERTa-zinc-base-v1, https://huggingface.co/seyonec/ChemBERTa-zinc-base-v1 (no licence
    declared on the Hub page - check before any commercial use)
  Mol-JEPA, https://huggingface.co/Flogrammer/Mol-JEPA (MIT at the pinned HEAD revision; an
    earlier revision of the same weight file declared CC BY-NC 4.0)
Pinned revisions, weights hashes and the licence caveat are in docs/upstream_audit.md.

